  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/6e64e31a8abb63137d86859b3a5fc417a18e6889.png\" alt=\"標誌\"></p><h2><strong>概述</strong></h2><hr><h4>Create: 夢想與渴望是一個為Create模組設計的擴充包，它添加了各種隨機的生活品質改進、物品與方塊功能，這些內容與舊版和新版Create模組都有關聯！</h4><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/174d0d55937391091adcf7bf9f4d835f146398f4.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/174d0d55937391091adcf7bf9f4d835f146398f4.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/43693c621633e855b49fe07f6252c6363603acd5.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/43693c621633e855b49fe07f6252c6363603acd5.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/92a7ca6939ac4acddfca6093ce303514849b40df.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/92a7ca6939ac4acddfca6093ce303514849b40df.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/c7318d4aea92b250b5a4a3c60a7194b0749875eb.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/c7318d4aea92b250b5a4a3c60a7194b0749875eb.png\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/acb8002560c889c31fb4c6f765d9b2e63cb5dd9e.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/JmybsfWs/images/acb8002560c889c31fb4c6f765d9b2e63cb5dd9e.png\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLuna\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/812868981806465075/1228619170615263283/image.png?ex=662cb3c4&amp;is=661a3ec4&amp;hm=0b533f867374aaaa365fd49bd3b1ccde55680fb7f8a01975b7bfd6bf133c4a8a&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>社群Fabric託管的Github專案，建議您在此處或Discord上回報問題\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fSappho%252fcreate_dd_fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codeberg.org/Sappho/create_dd_fabric</a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UHTbHcdkGx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/812868981806465075/1228619341755